.TH PDF-MINIFY 1 "October 2026" "PDF Minify 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pdf-minify \- make PDFs smaller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pdf-minify
[\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fIfile.pdf\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
PDF Minify makes PDFs smaller with a variety of filters, compression
algorithms and techniques, and extensive previews that give a quick
overview of each one's visual effect and file size. Every preview and
size is the actual file you would save.
.PP
Without a file, it reopens the last file opened.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Print detailed diagnostics to standard output.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show a short help message and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/realcarbonneau/pdf-minify
